1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:01,630
Minato cross-dressing

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:02,960
to play Viola...

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,300
That would work best.

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,380
Minato cross-dressing

5
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,550
to play Viola...

6
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,630
Huh?

7
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:09,930
This...

8
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:12,100
is our little secret.

9
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:16,390
Minato playing a female role...

10
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,480
True.

11
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,860
His acting just now
was actually quite good.

12
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,650
But I need you to explain.

13
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:26,740
He has barely any acting experience.

14
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,950
And you want him to cross-dress
to play a female lead?

15
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,410
Even if he has potential,

16
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:35,450
this is just too reckless.

17
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:38,500
Rin.

18
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,750
Get the dress and wig
we used in last year's play,

19
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:43,080
and have Minato try them on.

20
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:44,960
Right away.

21
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,810
Since he was already dressed up,
I went ahead and did his makeup too.

22
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:05,230
Minato, come over here.

23
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,320
This is beyond my wildest dreams!

24
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:21,410
My instincts are never wrong!

25
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,880
I ended up as the lead
in Twelfth Night,

26
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:28,250
playing Viola.

27
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:30,470
She's in love with Duke Orsino,
played by Haru-senpai.

28
00:01:30,470 --> 00:01:32,130
She's a woman in love,

29
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:33,340
who disguises herself as a man
for certain reasons.

30
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,890
It's a highly complex role.

31
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:36,970
Kaede-san plays

32
00:01:36,970 --> 00:01:38,850
the beloved Princess Olivia.

33
00:01:39,810 --> 00:01:40,980
But...

34
00:01:41,770 --> 00:01:42,850
I know Kaede-san

35
00:01:42,850 --> 00:01:45,700
has worked much harder than me...

36
00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:47,360
Is it really okay for me to play this role?
